{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaayvurenda/listens
    @copyright  2026 Oksigenia SL <dev@oksigenia.cc>
    @license    https://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    How many times a voice has been heard, as an audience: the place it is filling seen from above, each listen a
    seat taken, and beside it the count and the biggest place it has already filled. For the reader who recorded it
    (voice.php) and for the family (hear.php, «Su biblioteca»). The context comes from listens::context().

    The drawing is decoration (aria-hidden): the words beside it say everything.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "look": "noche",
        "svg": "<svg class=\"ayv-esc-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 190\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg>",
        "hasnumber": true, "digits": "27", "unit": "escuchas",
        "phrase": "Ya es más que una clase entera.",
        "next": "Para llenar el autobús faltan 30."
    }
}}
<figure class="ayv-esc ayv-esc-{{look}}">
    <div class="ayv-esc-placa">{{{svg}}}</div>
    <figcaption class="ayv-esc-texto">
        {{#hasnumber}}<p class="ayv-esc-cifra"><b>{{digits}}</b> {{unit}}</p>{{/hasnumber}}
        <p class="ayv-esc-frase">{{phrase}}</p>
        {{#next}}<p class="ayv-esc-luego">{{next}}</p>{{/next}}
    </figcaption>
</figure>
